index 0000000..70c3c54
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/COMPAT-26404334.md
@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+# Hotfix #4: Steam 26404334 / SVN 1285601 / v1.0.1.1
+
+This extends the earlier v1.7.0-based26319703 compatibility patch.
+Exact executable SHA256:
+`c5c9fe50c6398d2adedd98923c2d04bf9d9b4af64c1447ac167cdf8f874ff84f`.
+PE timestamp1793700549, image size0x1dde000.
+
+All eight existing Patch #1 signatures still match exactly once. Full
+PE-unwind-delimited function comparisons are instruction-equivalent after
+normalizing relative calls/branches and RIP-relative relocation offsets.
+This includes player-table, movement, daytime, registry, mining, chest,
+bases and chat-post functions. This is evidence for this executable only.
+
+Six hook RVAs remain unchanged; the two relocated sites are daytime
+0x969be2->0x969c72 and chat-post0x915170->0x915200.
+The scanner already resolves both by signatures. No absolute runtime addresses
+or unchecked fallback have been added. Mining retains the26319703 EAX-item,
+EBP-amount register layout. The existing required unique-match, unknown-build,
+defensive read and knowledge-capacity guards remain enabled.
+
+The production changes are the new accepted fingerprint and selecting the
+already-validated Patch #1 signatures/register layout for this build. Offline
+selftest expected RVAs are updated separately. Earlier builds remain supported.
+
+Configure `LIVEMAP_TEST_HOTFIX_EXE` alongside the original two private fixtures
+to run twelve CTest checks, including exact sites and unknown/corrupt/duplicate
+signature rejection across all three supplied executables. Do not distribute
+game executable fixtures with source.
+
+Use `LIVEMAP_LOCAL_SUFFIX=-dcraft.26404334` to identify a local build.
+An isolated copied-world Wine11 instance with no external networking served
+fresh time/weather, eight bases and all saved map-data routes. Steam connection
+cannot complete in that isolated network; this does not verify gameplay or
+normal Steam-connected shutdown. Real mining/movement/chest/knowledge acceptance
+for this hotfix still requires a player on the new build.
